WEBVTT

01:30.360 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:46.600 --> 01:48.280
The most fierce sword energy

01:49.320 --> 01:50.560
is not about being ruthless.

01:51.680 --> 01:53.080
It's sentimental.

02:00.440 --> 02:01.960
The energy of Hongmeng shredded chaos

02:02.960 --> 02:04.600
and created yin and yang, sky an earth.

02:05.200 --> 02:08.039
That is the most astonishing energy that's
ever been seen since the world was born.

02:09.400 --> 02:10.919
But it is

02:11.480 --> 02:12.720
not for destroying.

02:13.440 --> 02:14.440
Its name

02:15.240 --> 02:16.360
is called Beginning of Life.

04:42.920 --> 04:43.960
Ningxi.

04:45.480 --> 04:46.560
Where is she?

05:06.040 --> 05:08.320
When you attacked Moonlight Heights,

05:08.840 --> 05:10.880
I buried her in the Starfall Valley

05:11.960 --> 05:14.480
to protect her remains.

05:14.560 --> 05:16.800
I never had the courage to visit her.

05:19.880 --> 05:22.160
I've hated you for 20 years,

05:23.160 --> 05:25.360
and I just realized today

05:25.440 --> 05:27.680
that we both loved her deeply.

05:31.240 --> 05:34.360
But you deserve to see her
one last time more than me.

05:44.120 --> 05:47.200
She lies under the nameless tomb.

06:20.640 --> 06:21.920
Master.

06:22.000 --> 06:24.120
Master. Master.

06:25.040 --> 06:26.760
Master, don't scare me like that.

06:26.840 --> 06:28.320
Master, you are fine, right?

06:28.400 --> 06:30.120
I'll return your spiritual power
to you, Master.

06:30.200 --> 06:31.920
Master. Here's your spiritual power.

06:32.000 --> 06:32.840
Master.

06:32.920 --> 06:35.320
-It won't work.
-Master.

06:35.840 --> 06:38.160
I've run out of spiritual power,

06:38.240 --> 06:40.560
and my spiritual channel has lost vigor.

06:40.640 --> 06:44.040
Being able to transfer
all my power to you before I die

06:44.560 --> 06:46.360
gives my death meaning.

06:47.040 --> 06:48.360
I don't want it, Master.

06:48.440 --> 06:50.240
I don't want any of that.

06:50.320 --> 06:52.840
I just want you to be with me.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.200
Qiumin.

07:03.760 --> 07:05.160
Keep it close.

07:05.760 --> 07:07.320
The Hossu Sword

07:07.840 --> 07:10.680
is a heritage of Mirage Palace.

07:11.280 --> 07:12.640
It's yours now.

07:13.440 --> 07:15.720
Don't let my hopes for you be in vain.

07:15.800 --> 07:17.040
I don't want it, Master.

07:17.120 --> 07:18.280
Master. I don't want it.

07:18.360 --> 07:20.760
I don't want anything.

07:20.840 --> 07:22.720
Please stay with me.

07:22.800 --> 07:26.440
I'm not mature enough.
I need your guidance.

07:27.000 --> 07:29.600
Give it to me when I'm qualified.

07:29.680 --> 07:31.400
Silly girl.

07:31.960 --> 07:34.040
People have to grow up.

07:35.520 --> 07:36.560
Promise me

07:37.200 --> 07:38.640
that no matter what happens,

07:39.360 --> 07:40.960
hold it tight.

07:41.720 --> 07:43.960
I don't want it, Master.

07:44.040 --> 07:46.400
I just want you to be well.

07:46.480 --> 07:48.840
You can't leave.

07:58.240 --> 07:59.480
Ningxi,

08:01.280 --> 08:03.280
are you here to pick me up?

08:05.320 --> 08:07.480
I was wrong.

08:08.440 --> 08:11.120
Will you forgive me, Ningxi?

08:12.040 --> 08:13.040
Don't be afraid.

08:15.040 --> 08:16.840
I will protect you forever.

08:19.080 --> 08:20.720
We will never be apart.

08:28.320 --> 08:29.360
Master.

08:32.159 --> 08:33.280
Master.

08:34.440 --> 08:35.600
Master.

08:38.440 --> 08:39.600
Master.

08:40.120 --> 08:42.360
Master.

09:35.120 --> 09:36.160
Ningxi.

09:42.400 --> 09:44.560
Let's go home.

10:07.040 --> 10:08.000
How is she?

10:09.280 --> 10:10.320
She will live.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.800
It won't be long before she wakes up.

10:14.000 --> 10:15.640
But your condition…

10:16.800 --> 10:18.000
Nan Xuyue.

10:18.840 --> 10:20.000
I'll ask you again.

10:20.080 --> 10:22.600
What is affecting her
other than Heartstring?

10:36.840 --> 10:37.880
The Disillusion Water.

10:40.040 --> 10:41.720
It makes people forget love and hatred.

10:44.320 --> 10:46.480
So, that's the secret you told me about?

10:47.000 --> 10:48.280
You can see that her temperament
is twisted,

10:48.360 --> 10:49.200
and all she thinks about is serving evil.

10:49.280 --> 10:51.040
Why didn't you tell me the truth?

10:51.120 --> 10:53.560
How do you know
that she didn't drink it willingly?

10:54.520 --> 10:56.320
How do you know
that she wasn't trying to forget you?

10:57.480 --> 10:58.960
For the whole time,

10:59.040 --> 11:01.160
hasn't she gone through enough pain

11:01.240 --> 11:02.200
for you?

11:03.280 --> 11:05.800
What if she just wanted to be free?

11:20.880 --> 11:22.520
Let me tell you the answer.

11:26.840 --> 11:28.520
She never wanted to forget you.

11:40.000 --> 11:42.040
She doesn't remember
that she drank the Disillusion Water.

11:43.080 --> 11:45.120
All she remembers
is that she works for Sang Qi.

11:46.200 --> 11:48.600
That means her memories
were tampered with.

11:49.480 --> 11:51.920
The reason why
she keeps feeling the heartache

11:53.080 --> 11:54.680
is because the Disillusion Water

11:55.200 --> 11:57.480
can make people deny sentiments

11:58.360 --> 12:00.560
but not remove them completely.

12:01.640 --> 12:03.840
Each time she feels the heartache

12:06.960 --> 12:08.080
is the proof that she loves you.

12:12.360 --> 12:14.120
That's also why I'm jealous of you.

12:14.720 --> 12:16.040
In that case,

12:17.320 --> 12:18.760
why are you telling me this now?

12:18.840 --> 12:20.960
I just don't want to become
a hateful person

12:21.040 --> 12:22.760
that even I, myself, would despise.

12:26.200 --> 12:28.240
She's training in the path of sentiments,

12:28.920 --> 12:31.000
yet the Disillusion Water
is of the path of detachment.

12:31.080 --> 12:32.400
The medicine

12:32.960 --> 12:34.480
is conflicting with her faith.

12:35.640 --> 12:36.960
That means

12:37.480 --> 12:38.840
the stronger she is,

12:40.800 --> 12:41.720
the more dangerous her situation is.

12:43.800 --> 12:45.000
To save her,

12:45.880 --> 12:47.960
we have to detoxify the Disillusion Water.

12:49.400 --> 12:50.480
It sounds like

12:51.960 --> 12:53.560
you know how to undo it.

12:54.240 --> 12:55.920
There is one thing

12:56.000 --> 12:57.080
that counters the Disillusion Water.

12:57.160 --> 12:58.560
What is it?

13:02.000 --> 13:02.840
Lotus of Life.

13:04.240 --> 13:05.840
It grows on the Ethereal Jade Island,

13:06.480 --> 13:07.400
in the Waterless Land

13:07.480 --> 13:09.040
of the Phoenix Perch Forest
of the Dark Cloud Mountain.

13:09.560 --> 13:11.360
It will be found by Disillusion Grass.

13:11.960 --> 13:13.000
Disillusion Grass

13:13.520 --> 13:16.000
can numb people's sense
of sentiments and desires.

13:16.520 --> 13:17.920
The seeds of the Lotus of Life

13:18.000 --> 13:20.000
are the most bitter thing in the world.

13:20.800 --> 13:22.800
Two plants grow together
and counter each other.

13:22.880 --> 13:24.520
The bitterness of the seeds
of the Lotus of Life

13:25.280 --> 13:26.520
can detoxify the Disillusion Grass.

13:27.200 --> 13:28.400
I will take her

13:29.640 --> 13:31.320
to Dark Cloud Mountain when she wakes up.

13:32.080 --> 13:33.240
One more thing.

13:44.240 --> 13:45.760
Don't tell her about this just yet.

13:46.600 --> 13:48.080
The Disillusion Water is still working,

13:48.160 --> 13:49.640
so even if she wakes up,

13:50.160 --> 13:51.360
she's still feel unsentimental

13:51.440 --> 13:53.080
and hostile toward you.

13:53.160 --> 13:56.320
The more you say,
the more defensive she gets,

13:59.000 --> 14:00.400
making it even harder to cure her.

14:04.480 --> 14:05.680
Nan Xuyue.

14:07.760 --> 14:09.120
I suddenly realized

14:11.640 --> 14:13.400
that I don't know you that well.

14:19.680 --> 14:21.400
I told you.

14:21.920 --> 14:23.160
Ten years have passed.

14:24.320 --> 14:26.000
People change.

14:26.560 --> 14:27.960
So, it wasn't just me

14:29.440 --> 14:30.640
who changed over the last ten years.

14:34.040 --> 14:34.920
You've changed as well.

14:39.280 --> 14:40.560
Everyone

14:41.800 --> 14:43.040
and everything changed.

14:45.360 --> 14:47.480
Nothing remains constant in this world.

14:48.120 --> 14:49.360
For example,

14:50.200 --> 14:52.080
I told you the truth today,

14:53.160 --> 14:55.080
but that doesn't mean I gave her up.

14:57.760 --> 14:59.760
If I want to fight with you over her,

15:01.320 --> 15:02.760
what are you going to do?

15:06.840 --> 15:08.480
You don't have the chance anymore.

15:10.280 --> 15:11.720
I will keep her close.

15:16.280 --> 15:17.320
I hope you will.

15:19.960 --> 15:26.640
MIRAGE PALACE

15:39.720 --> 15:40.640
Excuse me.

15:41.400 --> 15:43.440
Where is Gao Qiumin?

15:43.960 --> 15:44.800
After the funeral,

15:44.880 --> 15:47.360
fellow sect members asked Miss Gao
to go to the main hall

15:47.440 --> 15:49.120
for important business.

15:49.640 --> 15:50.680
Over there.

15:57.200 --> 16:02.880
FLORA BLOOM

16:10.320 --> 16:11.600
How dare you sit on the leader's chair.

16:11.680 --> 16:13.840
Gao Qiumin, your behaviors
are not up to the code of the sect.

16:13.920 --> 16:16.920
Everyone in Mirage Palace
has complained about you over the years.

16:17.800 --> 16:20.360
We will never accept you

16:20.440 --> 16:22.000
as the Madam.

16:27.480 --> 16:28.520
Do you all agree with that?

16:38.680 --> 16:39.960
Gao Qiumin.

16:40.040 --> 16:41.320
Since we are already in this situation,

16:41.400 --> 16:42.840
I'll be straight with you.

16:43.760 --> 16:45.720
We are no boot-lickers.

16:45.800 --> 16:48.080
Our master is a relative to you.

16:48.160 --> 16:49.960
She favored you
and spoke for you all the time.

16:50.600 --> 16:52.160
If we offend you,

16:52.240 --> 16:53.320
there will be severe punishment.

16:53.920 --> 16:55.560
We were brought to heel by the situation.

16:56.080 --> 16:58.200
Our master has passed away.

16:58.800 --> 17:00.560
Things should return
to how they are supposed to be.

17:00.640 --> 17:01.680
Someone like you

17:01.760 --> 17:03.760
cannot be the leader of Mirage Palace.

17:04.640 --> 17:06.720
Every word you say sounds righteous.

17:06.800 --> 17:09.680
Yet it's nothing but an excuse
for trying to steal this position.

17:09.760 --> 17:11.720
Madam Su has just left us,

17:11.800 --> 17:13.960
and you are already trying
to bring a fellow member down.

17:16.760 --> 17:17.760
Mr. Fu.

17:17.839 --> 17:20.760
You haven't known Gao Qiumin for long.

17:20.839 --> 17:22.400
How can you know what she's like?

17:22.480 --> 17:23.960
I know she's a good person.

17:24.760 --> 17:26.280
As a member of the Jade Sky Palace,

17:26.880 --> 17:28.600
I shouldn't get involved
in Mirage Palace's affair.

17:29.360 --> 17:30.960
However, as Miss Gao's friend,

17:31.040 --> 17:32.600
I'd like to ask you.

17:33.160 --> 17:34.840
Do you truly not know

17:35.800 --> 17:38.040
who she truly is
after so many years together with her?

17:38.640 --> 17:41.200
Is her arrogance all you remember,
but all her changes are neglected?

17:42.160 --> 17:43.800
Has she never helped you

17:44.440 --> 17:46.200
and put in her efforts for you?

17:47.120 --> 17:48.040
Mr. Fu.

17:48.120 --> 17:50.760
You are our guest, and that's all you are.

17:50.840 --> 17:52.960
If you meddle
with Mirage Palace's internal affairs,

17:53.040 --> 17:53.960
we'll have to ask you to leave.

17:54.040 --> 17:55.400
Enough!

17:58.760 --> 18:00.560
I, Gao Qiumin, have never begged anyone.

18:01.160 --> 18:02.760
I'm not interested
in being the Madam as well.

18:03.280 --> 18:04.600
You can choose

18:04.680 --> 18:07.080
a qualified leader for Mirage Palace
as you wish.

18:10.920 --> 18:11.800
Let's go.

18:20.160 --> 18:21.120
You know

18:21.640 --> 18:22.760
that they said all those things

18:22.840 --> 18:23.880
for the power.

18:23.960 --> 18:25.240
SU NINGZHEN
THE NINTH MADAM OF MIRAGE PALACE

18:25.320 --> 18:26.160
It's okay.

18:26.240 --> 18:27.320
I know

18:27.840 --> 18:30.280
that I'm unpredictable, overbearing,

18:30.800 --> 18:32.040
and always a bully.

18:32.800 --> 18:33.760
That's not true.

18:34.280 --> 18:35.320
You are kind in your nature.

18:35.400 --> 18:37.000
You are always helping the weak.

18:39.120 --> 18:40.640
Who are you referring to?

18:42.720 --> 18:43.880
Me.

18:45.240 --> 18:46.560
How are you weak?

18:53.360 --> 18:55.080
I am not good enough.

18:56.120 --> 18:57.720
It's just that I thought

18:57.800 --> 18:59.120
they were forgiving

18:59.640 --> 19:00.840
because we are a family.

19:05.120 --> 19:07.720
Maybe I don't know how to treat my family.

19:08.280 --> 19:09.360
All my relatives

19:10.040 --> 19:11.520
have bad tempers.

19:14.120 --> 19:15.560
So do I.

19:18.600 --> 19:20.840
Whether I was in Moonlight Heights
or Mirage Palace,

19:20.920 --> 19:22.480
people have always

19:23.800 --> 19:25.600
criticized me

19:26.360 --> 19:27.640
for not being smart enough

19:28.160 --> 19:29.240
or powerful enough.

19:30.080 --> 19:31.640
I've always let them down.

19:33.840 --> 19:35.600
I understand it now.

19:35.680 --> 19:38.440
Their spoiling and help

19:39.720 --> 19:41.520
were because I was a…

19:42.600 --> 19:43.440
I…

19:46.680 --> 19:47.600
Never mind.

19:48.600 --> 19:49.680
No one truly likes me

19:51.520 --> 19:53.200
in this world.

20:00.800 --> 20:02.680
You don't know
how to get along with people

20:03.280 --> 20:05.640
because you were never treated well.

20:06.560 --> 20:07.720
That is not your fault.

20:08.880 --> 20:10.800
Why not forgive yourself?

20:13.480 --> 20:15.240
You just have to stop being annoying.

20:20.440 --> 20:21.640
Anyway,

20:21.720 --> 20:23.280
I think of you as a friend.

20:23.800 --> 20:25.320
It has nothing to do with your status.

20:28.000 --> 20:29.160
Honestly,

20:29.240 --> 20:30.640
even if you are your old self,

20:30.720 --> 20:32.720
if those people say mean things
to you again, I will say things back!

20:42.720 --> 20:44.360
There. Don't cry.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.280
Do you want a friendly hug?

20:57.000 --> 20:58.040
No!

21:01.120 --> 21:02.080
Miss Gao.

21:02.720 --> 21:04.000
Come with me to Jade Sky Palace.

21:08.120 --> 21:09.280
Fu Lansheng,

21:10.400 --> 21:12.920
even if I can't stay in Mirage Palace,

21:13.000 --> 21:14.480
I'm not homeless.

21:14.560 --> 21:15.560
I don't need your pity.

21:16.200 --> 21:17.720
I'm not pitying you.

21:18.280 --> 21:20.280
Isn't it common to invite a friend

21:20.800 --> 21:22.120
to visit my home?

21:22.720 --> 21:24.800
-Is it?
-Of course!

21:24.880 --> 21:26.320
Besides, Jade Sky Palace is huge.

21:26.400 --> 21:28.360
You can make yourself at home there.

21:28.440 --> 21:29.760
I don't mind sharing it with you.

21:33.080 --> 21:36.360
No need to share it with me.

21:36.880 --> 21:37.840
But

21:37.920 --> 21:40.120
visiting your home is in the picture.

21:40.200 --> 21:42.560
So, we have an agreement.

21:44.000 --> 21:45.280
Miss Gao.

21:47.360 --> 21:48.200
Mr. Xie.

21:53.000 --> 21:53.960
Miss Gao,

21:54.560 --> 21:57.720
I need to talk with you in private.

21:58.600 --> 21:59.920
Do you need me to help you

22:00.440 --> 22:01.920
with things in Mirage Palace?

22:04.480 --> 22:05.520
No.

22:05.600 --> 22:07.200
They don't like me,

22:07.280 --> 22:08.840
and I don't like them either.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.600
They can fight for the leadership

22:10.680 --> 22:12.680
of Mirage Palace however they want.

22:13.200 --> 22:14.040
I don't want it.

22:14.640 --> 22:15.800
If you need,

22:16.400 --> 22:17.360
you can come to Snow City.

22:18.680 --> 22:20.200
That's not necessary.

22:20.280 --> 22:22.160
Now you know that Mu Xuanling
is the Chaos Pearl,

22:22.760 --> 22:24.240
there's more reason for you
to protect her.

22:25.160 --> 22:26.600
If I'm in Snow City,

22:26.680 --> 22:29.160
she'd be annoyed seeing me,
and vice versa.

22:29.240 --> 22:30.720
I'm a liability to you anyway.

22:31.480 --> 22:33.080
About the fact that Mu Xuanling
is the Chaos Pearl,

22:33.600 --> 22:34.480
only herself,

22:34.560 --> 22:37.200
you, me, and Sang Qi know about it.

22:38.440 --> 22:39.720
I was thinking

22:40.480 --> 22:42.200
if you'd tell others about it.

22:42.800 --> 22:43.920
Now I know

22:45.280 --> 22:46.560
that you won't.

22:47.080 --> 22:48.080
I will.

22:48.160 --> 22:50.040
I… I didn't say anything because

22:50.120 --> 22:51.760
I want something on her,

22:51.840 --> 22:54.480
so that when she sees me, she'd be scared.

22:56.800 --> 22:59.280
Those who say stubborn words
have the most tender heart.

23:00.840 --> 23:02.400
My heart is nothing tender.

23:03.000 --> 23:04.080
Anyway,

23:05.440 --> 23:06.280
thank you.

23:20.520 --> 23:21.920
I can't open the barrier.

23:22.720 --> 23:24.440
Just get in.

23:30.520 --> 23:33.640
You are sneaking into my room
behind Xie Xuechen's back again.

23:34.200 --> 23:35.960
Do you have news for me?

23:37.320 --> 23:38.520
Sang Qi went back to the Dark Abyss.

23:40.160 --> 23:42.320
I heard that the gate to the Temple
of Divine Execution has been closed since,

23:42.400 --> 23:43.440
and he never showed his face after.

23:44.120 --> 23:45.760
I'm surprised to learn

23:45.840 --> 23:47.920
that Su Ningxi is the reason
Sang Qi hates humanity so much.

23:48.640 --> 23:49.560
That's good.

23:50.080 --> 23:52.320
Now that he's with Su Ningxi all day long,

23:52.840 --> 23:54.200
it would be less trouble
for the Immortal Alliance.

23:57.520 --> 23:59.200
It's just that Mirage Palace

23:59.280 --> 24:01.040
has suffered a great loss.

24:01.680 --> 24:03.360
What a pity.

24:04.880 --> 24:06.640
If we see things that way,

24:07.160 --> 24:10.240
their scheme ruined my master's life.

24:10.320 --> 24:11.920
Everyone was just getting their vengeance.

24:12.000 --> 24:13.560
No one owes the other side anything.

24:18.120 --> 24:18.960
I know

24:19.480 --> 24:21.760
you hate people who discriminate

24:22.280 --> 24:23.400
against the Spirit Clan.

24:24.520 --> 24:27.400
But you are not a person
who'd be blinded by hatred.

24:28.840 --> 24:30.080
I also know

24:30.160 --> 24:31.760
that you must be having

24:32.640 --> 24:34.680
mixed feelings right now.

24:36.560 --> 24:38.120
Don't worry.

24:38.640 --> 24:39.600
Things will be

24:40.720 --> 24:42.000
clear soon.

24:47.880 --> 24:49.080
What do you mean?

24:50.120 --> 24:51.360
This jade token

24:51.880 --> 24:53.120
is scripted with my defense array.

24:54.320 --> 24:55.600
If you are ever in danger,

24:56.120 --> 24:57.600
this can take an impact for you,

24:58.240 --> 24:59.520
even when facing
the Ultimate Jade Vault Technique.

25:03.600 --> 25:05.800
This is an unparalleled artifact.

25:06.320 --> 25:07.440
You are just giving it to me like that?

25:10.400 --> 25:11.440
It's just an artifact.

25:11.520 --> 25:12.560
There's nothing "unparalleled" about it.

25:13.160 --> 25:14.920
It's worth something only when it can

25:15.000 --> 25:16.280
offer protection to the one I care about.

25:16.800 --> 25:17.960
Just keep it.

25:33.560 --> 25:34.800
Go.

25:35.800 --> 25:36.880
This time,

25:36.960 --> 25:39.640
I'm going to give them a piece of my mind
regarding the food in the ice prison.

25:40.160 --> 25:41.960
I'm not taking you to the prison.

25:43.360 --> 25:44.240
Where to?

26:01.440 --> 26:05.520
ETHEREAL JADE ISLAND

26:09.440 --> 26:10.600
Xie Xuechen.

26:11.120 --> 26:13.640
Why did you bring me
to the Ethereal Jade Island?

26:14.720 --> 26:16.520
This is on the route
to the Dark Cloud Mountain.

26:17.120 --> 26:18.560
What are we doing there?

26:19.840 --> 26:21.160
To find a flower.

26:23.040 --> 26:24.080
What flower?

26:25.320 --> 26:26.400
The Lotus of Life.

26:27.960 --> 26:31.440
Mr. Xie, are you already thinking
about immortality at such a young age?

26:33.200 --> 26:35.120
Don't tell her about this just yet.

26:35.640 --> 26:37.120
The Disillusion Water is still working,

26:37.720 --> 26:39.080
so, even if she wakes up,

26:39.640 --> 26:41.680
telling her will make her more defensive,

26:41.760 --> 26:43.240
making it even harder to cure her.

26:46.440 --> 26:47.400
Yes.

26:50.480 --> 26:51.880
Why did you bring me?

26:52.880 --> 26:54.080
Who knows

26:54.720 --> 26:56.320
where you are going to run off to.

26:59.200 --> 27:00.680
The Ethereal Jade Island
is a territory of the Spirit Clan.

27:01.720 --> 27:03.560
The Spirit Clan of the East Sea
is disobedient

27:03.640 --> 27:04.640
and rough.

27:04.720 --> 27:05.960
Don't go poke them.

27:06.720 --> 27:08.040
We'll get back
right after getting the Lotus of Life.

27:10.920 --> 27:12.280
If you get yourself in trouble,

27:13.240 --> 27:14.320
you will deal with it.

27:16.480 --> 27:18.640
If I call you Mr. Xie here,

27:18.720 --> 27:20.960
will the lords of the Spirit Clan

27:21.040 --> 27:23.320
swarm in here to kill you?

27:24.360 --> 27:25.640
They don't have the nerve.

27:26.320 --> 27:27.440
And they are not capable.

27:27.960 --> 27:30.160
Mr. Xie is always so confident.

27:31.160 --> 27:32.920
I'm trying to cover up my sword energy

27:33.000 --> 27:34.120
to keep a low profile.

27:34.200 --> 27:35.240
You are the problem.

27:36.000 --> 27:37.800
Don't bring trouble
to the Spirit Clan of the East Sea.

27:42.800 --> 27:43.640
Are you hungry?

27:44.800 --> 27:45.840
No.

27:46.600 --> 27:48.120
Please enjoy. Here.

27:48.200 --> 27:49.320
Thank you.

28:14.880 --> 28:16.760
What are you looking at? Eat.

28:19.800 --> 28:21.560
Members of the Spirit Clan
are better than human beings.

28:21.640 --> 28:23.000
They are not hypocrites.

28:25.000 --> 28:27.120
They are showing their figure generously,

28:27.200 --> 28:28.920
and I'm showing my appreciation.

28:29.520 --> 28:30.720
What's wrong with that?

28:32.720 --> 28:33.880
Let's talk about you.

28:34.960 --> 28:35.920
Which one do you prefer?

28:37.000 --> 28:39.040
The sweet rabbit girl

28:39.920 --> 28:42.080
or the pretty Serpent Spirit?

28:44.080 --> 28:45.160
Don't worry.

28:45.240 --> 28:46.960
We are far from Snow City.

28:47.040 --> 28:49.000
You can fool around a little.

28:49.080 --> 28:50.200
I will keep your secrets.

28:50.280 --> 28:51.240
What do you say?

28:53.160 --> 28:55.240
There's nothing wrong with keeping quiet.

29:04.720 --> 29:06.360
Dark Cloud Mountain
is a dangerous place after dark.

29:06.440 --> 29:09.480
Finish food and rest.

29:09.560 --> 29:11.000
We will be on the road
early in the morning.

29:17.320 --> 29:18.520
Come.

29:29.640 --> 29:31.840
Human cultivator,
do you need a room for the night?

29:32.720 --> 29:35.240
We are fully booked today.

29:35.320 --> 29:37.640
But I have a huge room

29:38.280 --> 29:39.800
with a comfortable bed.

29:39.880 --> 29:42.280
Cultivator, do you want to stay with me?

29:42.360 --> 29:43.520
It will be free.

29:48.120 --> 29:49.200
Madam She,

29:51.720 --> 29:53.080
you have set your eyes
on a human being again.

29:53.600 --> 29:55.600
Is there something wrong
with the Fox Clan?

29:56.320 --> 29:59.800
You know, I like
decent and clean human beings.

29:59.880 --> 30:01.960
They are not fox spirits like you,

30:02.040 --> 30:03.040
knowing no shame.

30:03.120 --> 30:04.880
That's why we are a match.

30:04.960 --> 30:06.080
Take a walk!

30:10.840 --> 30:13.680
Girl, are you a couple
with this cultivator?

30:14.360 --> 30:15.200
Yes.

30:26.560 --> 30:28.640
Oh, you can't talk.

30:29.160 --> 30:30.800
What a pity.

30:31.400 --> 30:33.440
That's fine.

30:42.400 --> 30:45.040
My place is not a playground

30:45.120 --> 30:46.400
for you.

30:47.320 --> 30:48.240
You can leave,

30:48.320 --> 30:49.680
but you will have to leave
your shrinking pocket here.

30:50.640 --> 30:52.200
The Spirit Clan of the East Sea
has passed its prime time.

30:53.200 --> 30:55.080
A tiny snake can rule a land.

30:56.360 --> 30:57.200
Cultivator,

30:57.280 --> 30:59.800
if you can accept this member
of the Spirit Clan,

30:59.880 --> 31:01.360
why not me?

31:01.880 --> 31:03.000
That's okay.

31:03.080 --> 31:05.400
I don't mind that you are a human being.

31:05.480 --> 31:06.800
I can enjoy you all the same.

31:07.440 --> 31:09.080
Can you stop talking?

31:09.720 --> 31:11.160
This one is not for you to mess with.

31:14.840 --> 31:15.960
You deal with her.

31:16.800 --> 31:18.040
Why not do it yourself?

31:19.200 --> 31:20.840
You are more than sufficient
to deal with a tiny serpent.

31:20.920 --> 31:22.280
Or

31:23.160 --> 31:24.560
do you want to keep being mute?

31:24.640 --> 31:26.760
I'll do it!

31:27.600 --> 31:28.640
So, you…

31:31.560 --> 31:33.080
-Charge!
-Wait!

31:43.440 --> 31:46.360
The Spirit Clan worships power.

31:46.440 --> 31:48.600
I was stupid to offend you.

31:48.680 --> 31:50.600
Quick. Prepare a top-notch room.

31:50.680 --> 31:51.800
Two rooms.

31:51.880 --> 31:52.720
One room.

31:54.240 --> 31:55.640
It will be too small for two people.

31:56.160 --> 31:57.040
No, it won't.

31:57.120 --> 31:59.320
Our top-notch room is really big.

31:59.400 --> 32:01.720
You won't find it too small.

32:02.320 --> 32:04.400
Come with me. I have questions.

32:11.440 --> 32:12.800
You have quite the freedom
with your actions.

32:14.080 --> 32:15.600
You must have been
running this place for long.

32:16.200 --> 32:17.920
Do you know about a place called

32:18.000 --> 32:19.360
Phoenix Perch Forest
in the Dark Cloud Mountain?

32:19.440 --> 32:21.440
What are they doing there?

32:21.520 --> 32:23.520
That place is covered in miasma
and is full of rare animals.

32:23.600 --> 32:25.520
Among them, some cause death,
and some cause illusion.

32:25.600 --> 32:27.240
They are quite brutal.

32:27.320 --> 32:29.600
-No one dared to travel there in years.
-Get me a map.

32:30.480 --> 32:32.560
All right. Leave it to me.

32:32.640 --> 32:34.240
-Waiter!
-Yes.

32:34.320 --> 32:35.640
This way, please.

32:39.680 --> 32:41.000
Please.

32:52.840 --> 32:54.200
Madam She,

32:54.280 --> 32:56.520
why are you doing his bid
after getting hit by them?

32:57.440 --> 32:58.720
Are you really in love with him?

32:59.880 --> 33:01.640
You don't get it.

33:01.720 --> 33:04.640
Snakes knows when to bow
and when to stand up.

33:05.480 --> 33:06.640
I should have been more cautious.

33:07.600 --> 33:10.040
I thought that was just a common
cultivator in the golden essence stage.

33:10.120 --> 33:12.440
He caught a girl from the Spirit Clan
and was hiding here.

33:12.960 --> 33:14.080
Who would have thought

33:14.160 --> 33:16.720
that he's a master
in the spiritual form level?

33:23.600 --> 33:25.280
That the Serpent Spirit

33:25.360 --> 33:27.000
was so vulnerable.

33:27.720 --> 33:29.280
Maybe I'm just too good.

33:31.520 --> 33:33.000
Do you really think so?

33:34.760 --> 33:36.320
Are you saying

33:36.840 --> 33:37.800
that I'm not good?

33:38.520 --> 33:39.840
You said it.

33:40.440 --> 33:41.520
I didn't say anything.

33:46.640 --> 33:47.760
Why didn't I just kill you

33:47.840 --> 33:49.840
when we were in the Lava?

33:50.960 --> 33:52.080
As I recall it, you said

33:53.160 --> 33:54.400
that you like me too much to do that.

34:06.160 --> 34:07.320
You can take the bed.

34:08.120 --> 34:08.960
I'll just meditate here.

34:09.040 --> 34:10.960
I'm a prisoner.

34:11.480 --> 34:12.760
How can I take the bed?

34:12.840 --> 34:14.440
I would be grateful

34:14.520 --> 34:16.320
if given a chair.

34:18.639 --> 34:20.560
You know that you are a prisoner.

34:21.639 --> 34:23.080
You should behave.

34:23.920 --> 34:25.440
Is this your payback?

34:26.080 --> 34:27.320
I pulled your leg

34:27.400 --> 34:29.920
when your spiritual channel
was sealed off,

34:30.000 --> 34:31.560
and now you are

34:31.639 --> 34:33.159
getting back at me even worse.

34:34.000 --> 34:35.840
I can't believe
that the leader of the Immortal Alliance

34:35.920 --> 34:38.080
is such a vindictive person.

34:39.960 --> 34:41.080
Is that how you see me?

34:43.040 --> 34:45.000
Or what? Am I wrong?

34:46.440 --> 34:47.880
Do you remember

34:48.600 --> 34:49.920
what you did to me?

34:58.120 --> 34:59.280
So,

35:01.760 --> 35:03.560
do you want me to pay you back

35:04.320 --> 35:05.440
and be vindictive for that?

35:09.160 --> 35:10.520
Or

35:11.400 --> 35:12.960
would you just behave?

35:17.440 --> 35:18.600
I don't need you to pay me back.

35:19.480 --> 35:20.320
I'll go to bed.

35:29.640 --> 35:31.840
You are the lofty leader of Snow City

35:31.920 --> 35:32.840
and the Immortal Alliance.

35:33.480 --> 35:35.000
You carry the justice of the world
on your shoulders.

35:35.560 --> 35:37.160
Why waste your energy on me?

35:38.600 --> 35:41.320
If you feel offended about my intrusion

35:41.400 --> 35:42.680
when we first met,

35:43.720 --> 35:44.560
I apologize.

35:45.160 --> 35:46.360
Please stop messing with me.

36:08.320 --> 36:09.680
What is he doing here?

36:10.200 --> 36:13.840
Is he really here
for the medicine of immortality?

36:14.560 --> 36:17.120
Nan Xuyue gave me the jade token
before this trip.

36:17.680 --> 36:18.520
Is it because

36:18.600 --> 36:20.440
he knew where Xie Xuechen
would be taking me?

36:24.920 --> 36:26.200
Are you having trouble falling asleep?

36:31.600 --> 36:33.320
Have my behaviors recently

36:33.840 --> 36:35.440
made you feel strange?

36:35.960 --> 36:36.800
That's my fault.

36:38.040 --> 36:40.080
But there's one thing
that I should be clear about.

36:42.000 --> 36:43.960
I have never tried to mess with you.

36:45.000 --> 36:46.160
Not before,

36:47.240 --> 36:48.480
not now.

36:52.920 --> 36:53.760
Sure.

36:53.840 --> 36:55.960
Mr. Xie is a decent man.

36:56.040 --> 36:57.560
You are forgiving and generous.

36:58.640 --> 37:00.000
I've been thinking too much.

37:05.200 --> 37:06.560
Rest well, then.

37:07.440 --> 37:08.440
We'll leave first thing in the morning.

37:27.440 --> 37:29.200
-Young Master.
-Yes.

37:29.280 --> 37:31.040
Father. Mother. We are back.

37:31.720 --> 37:33.120
I'm Gao Qiumin.

37:33.200 --> 37:35.320
Nice to meet you, Mr. Fu, Elder Duan.

37:36.280 --> 37:38.400
No need for such formality. Sit, please.

37:43.600 --> 37:45.520
I heard that Madam Su left.

37:45.600 --> 37:46.560
It happened so quickly

37:46.640 --> 37:48.520
that we couldn't have gotten there in time
to pay our condolences.

37:48.600 --> 37:49.560
Please forgive us for that.

37:50.320 --> 37:52.160
Is everything okay in Mirage Palace?

37:52.240 --> 37:53.880
Elder Duan, thank you for your concern.

37:53.960 --> 37:55.320
Everything is well.

37:57.840 --> 37:59.480
Speaking of which,

37:59.560 --> 38:02.840
Miss Gao is Madam Su's direct disciple.

38:03.360 --> 38:04.720
Now that she has passed away,

38:04.800 --> 38:07.840
there must be a lot of things
to be taken care of in the palace.

38:07.920 --> 38:10.040
How come you…

38:11.040 --> 38:12.240
My seniors are taking care

38:12.320 --> 38:14.120
of things in the palace.

38:15.680 --> 38:18.280
Mother! I was worried
that Qiumin might be upset.

38:18.360 --> 38:19.800
That's why I asked her to visit us.

38:20.400 --> 38:21.640
Stop saying that.

38:23.880 --> 38:26.520
In that case, you should
entertain our guests well.

38:27.520 --> 38:28.360
Miss Gao.

38:28.440 --> 38:30.600
Stay in Jade Sky Palace for some time.

38:30.680 --> 38:31.840
You always work hard on your cultivation.

38:31.920 --> 38:33.760
You might be a good influence to Sheng.

38:33.840 --> 38:35.040
Sheng,

38:35.120 --> 38:36.880
this is the day

38:36.960 --> 38:38.640
that the five business managers
report their accounts.

38:38.720 --> 38:39.920
Go deal with it.

38:40.000 --> 38:41.120
Don't keep them waiting.

38:41.720 --> 38:43.160
Am I right, Miss Gao?

38:43.760 --> 38:47.280
We should let Butler Huang
arrange a room in your yard

38:47.360 --> 38:49.680
for Miss Gao to settle down.

38:49.760 --> 38:50.960
All right. I'll take her to my yard first.

38:51.040 --> 38:51.880
Come on.

38:52.440 --> 38:55.040
The managers have been waiting
for two hours now.

38:55.120 --> 38:57.200
-Go!
-Don't let me keep you.

38:58.200 --> 38:59.520
Please excuse me.

39:07.360 --> 39:08.480
I'll go!

39:12.200 --> 39:13.040
Elder Duan,

39:13.120 --> 39:14.600
what was that about?

39:16.240 --> 39:17.280
Honey!

39:17.800 --> 39:18.960
Honey!

39:19.960 --> 39:21.240
Honey,

39:21.320 --> 39:23.560
didn't you try to set her up with Sheng?

39:23.640 --> 39:25.920
Why did you give her
the cold shoulder today?

39:28.600 --> 39:30.320
Gao Qiumin

39:30.920 --> 39:32.200
has clearly lost power

39:32.280 --> 39:34.240
and is abandoned by Mirage Palace.

39:35.560 --> 39:37.440
So? Are you abandoning her as well?

39:38.040 --> 39:39.320
Abandon?

39:39.400 --> 39:40.640
Even if she's not in a good place,

39:40.720 --> 39:42.840
she's still from a prestigious family
and was born with nine apertures.

39:42.920 --> 39:45.200
She's more than enough for our silly boy.
What are you thinking?

39:45.280 --> 39:46.800
Abandon?

39:46.880 --> 39:48.320
So, why the cold shoulder?

39:50.480 --> 39:52.440
I heard that the mother-in-law

39:52.520 --> 39:55.840
has to show her daughter-in-law
some authority.

39:55.920 --> 39:56.960
How did I do?

39:58.760 --> 40:00.800
When has she ever agreed
to be your daughter-in-law?

40:00.880 --> 40:02.560
What's not good about being my daughter?

40:02.640 --> 40:04.640
Even if she wants the moon in the sky,
I'd still get it for her.

40:05.720 --> 40:07.280
It should be up to her will!

40:09.320 --> 40:11.160
Yes! You did good!

40:15.880 --> 40:16.720
-Our Young Master…
-Try and get me!

40:16.800 --> 40:18.080
-Stop there!
-has always been good to the servants.

40:18.160 --> 40:19.320
-Stop running!
-So,

40:19.400 --> 40:21.160
-Got you!
-the maids here are mercurial.

40:21.240 --> 40:23.000
-What is it?
-She beat me!

40:23.520 --> 40:25.080
-Ahem.
-She bullied me.

40:25.160 --> 40:26.360
Who are you?

40:26.440 --> 40:29.240
Are you also brought here by Young Master?
Where is he?

40:30.280 --> 40:31.560
Are you Young Master's new friend?

40:31.640 --> 40:33.600
-You are stunning!
-I agree with her.

40:34.200 --> 40:35.040
You are so beautiful.

40:37.360 --> 40:40.680
He has been quite the playboy.

40:44.200 --> 40:45.600
The accounts

40:45.680 --> 40:47.480
are the most boring.

40:48.560 --> 40:51.400
A few million tael makes no difference

40:51.480 --> 40:52.320
when put

40:53.280 --> 40:54.840
in the general account.

40:55.360 --> 40:57.280
Young Master, you are a blessed person.

40:57.360 --> 41:00.120
Leave the trivial matters

41:00.200 --> 41:03.320
to men who are not blessed like us.

41:03.400 --> 41:05.480
Mr. Zeng manages all the silk business.

41:05.560 --> 41:07.440
If you are not blessed,

41:07.520 --> 41:09.120
is there anyone in this world who is?

41:09.880 --> 41:11.720
That would be you, Young Master.

41:12.920 --> 41:16.240
I heard that you came back

41:16.320 --> 41:17.840
with a beautiful girl from Mirage Palace.

41:17.920 --> 41:20.960
People say that she was born
with nine spiritual channels.

41:21.040 --> 41:24.720
That makes us envy you.

41:24.800 --> 41:26.240
Yes.

41:26.320 --> 41:28.120
You are quite resourceful.

41:31.200 --> 41:34.400
I wonder what Miss Gao is doing right now.

41:34.480 --> 41:36.200
Is she fighting with people in my yard?

41:36.720 --> 41:38.280
I need to head back and check things out.

41:38.360 --> 41:39.720
I can't afford anyone to offend her.

41:41.720 --> 41:42.680
Master.

41:42.760 --> 41:44.880
-Take care, Young Master.
-Take care, Young Master.

41:46.240 --> 41:48.720
Oh, right!
Thank you for your efforts lately.

41:49.600 --> 41:51.400
That's okay.

41:51.480 --> 41:53.720
No wonder the accounts
are not detailed enough.

41:53.800 --> 41:55.040
You know what?

41:55.120 --> 41:57.920
Mr. Wang will be managing
the silk business with you

41:58.000 --> 41:59.800
in case you don't have enough energy.

41:59.880 --> 42:00.840
Yes.

42:01.400 --> 42:03.120
Young Master.

42:03.200 --> 42:05.680
Young Master was quite timid
when he was young.

42:05.760 --> 42:07.840
A grasshopper once got onto his foot,

42:07.920 --> 42:09.800
and he just stood still there,

42:09.880 --> 42:11.160
with tears running down his face.

42:11.240 --> 42:13.040
-He was so cute!
-Really?

42:15.280 --> 42:16.280
Your turn.

42:19.280 --> 42:20.400
-That's nice.
-So nice.

42:20.480 --> 42:22.080
-It's beautiful.
-Indeed.

42:22.160 --> 42:23.560
That's true.

42:24.080 --> 42:25.240
-Young Master.
-Young Master.

42:25.320 --> 42:26.600
-Young Master.
-It took you long enough.

42:26.680 --> 42:29.720
Why I'm hearing bad things
about me once I get back?

42:32.200 --> 42:33.920
It's nothing.

42:34.000 --> 42:36.560
-We are one family.
-One family.

42:37.960 --> 42:41.040
We'll leave Young Master
and Qiumin to talk.

42:41.120 --> 42:43.080
-Please excuse us.
-See you.

42:43.160 --> 42:44.440
-See you.
-Let's go!

42:44.520 --> 42:46.160
-Come on.
-Hurry up.

42:50.200 --> 42:52.400
I thought you'd feel uncomfortable.

42:52.480 --> 42:55.680
In such a short time,
you've joined the family.

42:55.760 --> 42:56.640
Of course!

42:56.720 --> 42:58.240
They are good to me.

42:58.320 --> 42:59.960
I feel happy being with them.

43:00.040 --> 43:02.360
It's mainly because of my beauty.

43:02.440 --> 43:04.080
I am an outstanding person.

43:06.920 --> 43:08.520
Yes. That's true.

43:10.440 --> 43:12.240
Ling Yan told me

43:12.320 --> 43:14.680
that they are Spirit Clan members
saved by you.

43:14.760 --> 43:16.080
They were nice to me

43:16.160 --> 43:17.960
because you've always been nice to them.

43:20.120 --> 43:21.200
Right?

43:22.480 --> 43:23.320
Sort of.

43:27.000 --> 43:27.840
Thank you.

43:28.480 --> 43:29.840
Why are you thanking me?

43:30.880 --> 43:32.040
My mother was weird,

43:32.120 --> 43:34.560
yet you are not mad at me,
and I feel glad for that.

43:35.520 --> 43:36.640
I won't.

43:37.160 --> 43:38.760
You told me

43:38.840 --> 43:40.640
that being a kind person

43:40.720 --> 43:41.920
is kind.

43:42.000 --> 43:43.400
Stop there!

43:44.040 --> 43:45.240
You are being so nice all of a sudden.

43:45.320 --> 43:47.920
I suspect that you
are possessed or something.

43:48.000 --> 43:49.560
I'm living under your roof now.

43:49.640 --> 43:50.680
I should say nice things.

43:50.760 --> 43:52.320
Is this how you should be
for living under my roof?

43:53.000 --> 43:54.720
I'm living under your roof.

43:56.000 --> 43:57.840
It's how things should be.
